Package: forestPulse
Type: Package
Title: Analyzing Forest Eco-Pulse from Field and Remote Sensing Data in R
Version: 0.2.2
Authors@R: person(given = "Sushil", family = "Paudel", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "clarkesushi@gmail.com")
Description: A comprehensive toolkit for processing, analyzing and 
    monitoring ecological changes in forest ecosystems using field 
    data and remote sensing imagery. Designed to support researchers, ecologists and 
    forest managers in quantifying disturbance events and tracking 
    long-term ecosystem dynamics.
